OL,3,GDumfries, Galloway, Lothian & Borders
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FOutbreaks of
OL,6,Frain, heavy at times in the east, but
OL,7,Fmainly dry over Dumfries and Galloway.
OL,8,FThe rain clears then dry with clear
OL,9,Fspells and becoming chilly overnight
OL,10,Fwith a frost in places.
OL,11,
OL,12,CSaturday:FMainly dry at first. Rain,
OL,13,Fheavy at times, will spread east
OL,14,Fduring the morning. The wind will
OL,15,Fstrengthen from the morning, reaching
OL,16,Fgale to severe gale later.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
