OL,3,GDumfries, Galloway, Lothian & Borders
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Sunday to Tuesday:FStorm
OL,6,FBoelo will bring severe gales and
OL,7,Fheavy showers Sunday, these easing
OL,8,Flater. Dry and bright morning Monday,
OL,9,Fbecoming windy with rain later. Very
OL,10,Fwindy with showers, some heavy,
OL,11,FTuesday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
